# 【19 生效設定】每個值用了什麼、來源是 conf(設定檔)、derived(推算)還是 default(預設)
$ ./opmenu.sh --run 19
  每個值的來源:conf = opmenu.conf、derived = 自動推算、default = 預設
BACKEND              conf      docker
ENV_LABEL            conf      DEMO
BOOTSTRAP            conf      broker1:9094,broker2:9094
MDS_URL              conf      https://broker1:8091
KAFKA_CLUSTER_ID     derived   XyZBQ3-GTvKH2qNfP7X33A
CERT_DIR             default   /etc/kafka/secrets
TRUSTSTORE           default   /etc/kafka/secrets/truststore.p12
CA_PEM               default   /etc/kafka/secrets/ca.pem
CONTROLLER_HOSTS     conf      controller1
BROKER_SERVICES      conf      broker1 broker2
AUX_SERVICES         conf      restproxy control-center
HOSTS                derived   broker1 broker2 restproxy control-center controller1
DATA_DIR             conf      /var/lib/kafka/data
REPLICATION          derived   2
SSH_AUTH             default   key
TICKET_MODE          default   required
